      "problem": "| $x$ | $1$ | $3$ | $5$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{X|Y}(x\\,|\\,5)$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{1}{2}$ |\n\nFind the $\\text{E}[X\\,|\\,Y=5]$ given that the conditional probability mass function ${f}_{X|Y}(x\\,|\\,5)$ is shown in the table above.",
